when I'm waiting for shooting stars.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}The stars must think I look silly!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

